HTTP Methods

1. GET (Fetch data)
    await http.get(url);

2. POST (Send data)
   await http.post(url, body: {...});

3. PUT / PATCH (Update)
   * PUT → replace entire data
   * PATCH → update part

4 DELETE (delete data)

